#Title the sound of a place
#Composer SuperForge (procedural)
#Tempo 70

; Echo volume/feedback = ROOM A's acoustics (the boot default). Room B
; re-shapes the SAME echo unit at runtime through the room_b_ambience SFX
; (sound-effects.txt); room A's SFX restores these exact values. The echo
; DELAY is constant for the whole program — the pin's compiler refuses
; set_echo_delay inside a sound effect (see sound-effects.txt header), so
; the rooms differ by EVOL/EFB against one fixed 128 ms buffer (16 KiB of
; ARAM, reserved once at song start, never resized).
#EchoLength 128
#EchoVolume 12
#EchoFeedback 24
#FirFilter 127 0 0 0 0 0 0 0

@1 pluck
@2 square_lead
@3 tri_bass

; A = pluck melody (echo), B = pulse harmony (echo), C = bass (dry).
; Bar 8 is a deliberate near-silence: in room B the echo tail rings
; through it, in room A it collapses -- the audibility test's window.

A @1 v12 o4 E1 l8
B @2 v7  o3 E1 l2
C @3 v10 o2 l4

A L
A a r c+ r e r c+ r | b r d r f+ r d r
A a r c+ r e r a r | g+ f+ e d c+ r a r
A a r c+ r e r c+ r | b r d r f+ r d r
A e r c+ r a r e r | a2 r2

B L
B a f+ | b g | a f+ | e c+
B a f+ | b g | a e | a r

C L
C a a e e | b b f+ f+ | a a e e | c+ c+ e e
C a a e e | b b f+ f+ | a e a e | a r r r
